  '{0}'::int[],
  'Option A (To store, share, and reuse ML features for training and inference) is the primary purpose of Amazon SageMaker Feature Store. It provides a centralized repository for curated features, ensuring consistency between training and inference. Option B (To automatically label data for supervised learning) is a function of Amazon SageMaker Ground Truth. Option C (To detect bias in machine learning models) is handled by Amazon SageMaker Clarify. Option D (To deploy machine learning models to production) is a broader SageMaker capability.',
