  '{0}'::int[],
  'Option A (correct) states the primary purpose of Amazon SageMaker Clarify, which is to help detect potential bias in machine learning models and provide explainability for their predictions, both before and after training. Option B describes Amazon SageMaker Automatic Model Tuning (HPO). Option C describes Amazon SageMaker Model Monitor. Option D describes Amazon SageMaker Training Jobs, potentially with distributed training capabilities.',
