  '{1}'::int[],
  'Option B (correct) accurately describes the primary purpose of threshold tuning, which involves adjusting the probability cutoff to classify instances, thereby optimizing the trade-off between metrics like precision and recall, or false positive and false negative rates. Option A is related to model optimization, not threshold tuning. Option C is feature engineering. Option D is algorithm selection, often part of AutoML or manual experimentation.',
