  '{0}'::int[],
  'Option A (correct) accurately defines transfer learning as the technique of reusing a model pre-trained on a large dataset for a new, often related task. This approach significantly reduces training time and data requirements. Option B describes traditional training. Option C describes ensemble methods. Option D describes hyperparameter tuning.',
