  '{2}'::int[],
  'Option C (To organize, track, compare, and evaluate machine learning experiments) is the primary benefit of Amazon SageMaker Experiments. It allows data scientists to manage the entire ML workflow, including data preprocessing, model training, and evaluation, by tracking all artifacts and parameters. Option A describes SageMaker model deployment features. Option B describes SageMaker Model Monitor. Option D describes SageMaker Clarify.',
  NOW(),
