  '["Application Auto Scaling","Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling","AWS Lambda","Amazon SQS"]'::json,
  '{0}',
  'Option A (Application Auto Scaling) is the service that allows you to configure automatic scaling for Amazon SageMaker endpoints. It enables you to define target tracking, step scaling, or simple scaling policies based on metrics like CPU utilization or invocation count. Option B (Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling) is specifically for EC2 instances, not SageMaker endpoints. Option C (AWS Lambda) is a serverless compute service. Option D (Amazon SQS) is a message queuing service.',
