  'Which AWS service is commonly used in an MLOps CI/CD pipeline to compile source code, run unit tests, and package model artifacts or Docker images?',
  'mcq',
  '["Amazon S3","AWS Lambda","AWS CodeBuild","Amazon DynamoDB"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (AWS CodeBuild) is the correct service. AWS CodeBuild is a fully managed continuous integration service that compiles source code, runs tests, and produces deployable artifacts, making it ideal for the build and test stages of an MLOps CI/CD pipeline. Option A (Amazon S3) is object storage. Option B (AWS Lambda) is a serverless compute service for running code in response to events. Option D (Amazon DynamoDB) is a NoSQL database.',
