  '{0}',
  'Option A (Amazon SageMaker Neo) is specifically designed to compile and optimize machine learning models for deployment on a wide range of hardware targets, including edge devices, to improve performance and reduce resource consumption. Option B (Amazon SageMaker Studio) is an integrated development environment. Option C (Amazon SageMaker Ground Truth) is for data labeling. Option D (Amazon SageMaker Feature Store) is for managing and serving machine learning features.',
