  '{2}',
  'Option C (Data quality monitoring) is the Amazon SageMaker Model Monitor capability that helps identify issues like missing values, incorrect data types, or out-of-range values in the input data. It compares the characteristics of the incoming data against a baseline to detect anomalies. Option A (Model quality monitoring) tracks performance metrics. Option B (Bias drift monitoring) tracks fairness. Option D (Feature attribution drift monitoring) tracks feature importance.',
