  '["Infrastructure monitoring","Data quality monitoring","Concept drift detection","Network latency monitoring"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (Concept drift detection) is essential to detect when the relationship between input features and the target variable changes over time. This type of drift means the ''concept'' the model learned is no longer valid, leading to decreased accuracy. Option A (Infrastructure monitoring) focuses on hardware health. Option B (Data quality monitoring) focuses on changes in input data distribution. Option D (Network latency monitoring) focuses on network performance.',
