  '{0}',
  'Option A (Amazon SageMaker Feature Store) is specifically designed to store, share, and manage curated features for machine learning, ensuring consistency between training and inference environments (addressing anti-pattern ap-1.2-002). Option B (Amazon SageMaker Ground Truth) is for data labeling. Option C (Amazon SageMaker Clarify) is for detecting bias and explaining model predictions. Option D (Amazon SageMaker Processing) is for running processing jobs for data preparation or model evaluation. Option E (Amazon SageMaker Data Wrangler) is for data aggregation and preparation, but the Feature Store is for persistent storage and reuse of features.',
