  '{0}',
  'Option A (Amazon SageMaker Clarify) is specifically designed to help detect potential bias in machine learning models and datasets, both before training and after deployment (addressing anti-pattern ap-1.3-002). Option B (Amazon SageMaker Ground Truth) is for data labeling. Option C (Amazon SageMaker Feature Store) is for storing and reusing features. Option D (Amazon SageMaker Data Wrangler) is for data preparation and feature engineering. Option E (Amazon SageMaker Processing) is a general-purpose service for running data processing jobs.',
