  '{0,2}',
  'Option A (XGBoost) is a powerful, tree-based ensemble algorithm that can be used for both classification and regression tasks and is highly optimized for performance and scalability on SageMaker. Option C (Linear Learner) is a supervised learning algorithm that can solve both classification and regression problems, making it suitable for predicting continuous target variables. Option B (Image Classification) and Option E (Object Detection) are built-in algorithms specifically designed for computer vision tasks. Option D (k-means) is an unsupervised clustering algorithm, not suitable for supervised regression.',
