  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'Option A (correct) is the initial organizational step to define the experiment context. Option B (correct) involves executing the various training iterations. Option C (correct) is the continuous process of recording relevant data from each trial. Option D (correct) is the final step where the collected data is leveraged for comparative analysis and decision-making. This order ensures a systematic approach to experiment tracking and comparison.',
