  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'To train an image classification model using a built-in SageMaker algorithm, the initial step is to upload the image dataset to Amazon S3 (Option B), as SageMaker training jobs consume data from S3. Next, select an appropriate built-in image classification algorithm (Option C) from SageMaker''s offerings. After selecting the algorithm, configure the SageMaker training job (Option A) by specifying instance types, hyperparameters, and S3 data paths. Finally, launch the SageMaker training job (Option D) to begin the model training process.',
