  '{2,0,1,3}',
  'The first step in any ML project is to clearly define the business problem and its scope (Option C), as this provides the fundamental direction. Following this, identify the key performance indicators (KPIs) (Option A) that will measure the model''s success against the business problem. With objectives set, gather initial raw data (Option B) from relevant sources. Finally, perform exploratory data analysis (EDA) (Option D) on the gathered data to understand its characteristics, quality, and potential for modeling.',
