  '{1,3,2,0}',
  'To evaluate the suitability of a pre-trained model, first identify the original task and dataset it was trained on (Option B) to understand its inherent capabilities. Next, determine if the features learned by the pre-trained model (Option D) are relevant to the new target task. If deemed relevant, fine-tune the pre-trained model on a small portion of the target dataset (Option C) to adapt it. Finally, assess the performance of the fine-tuned model (Option A) on the target dataset to confirm its effectiveness for the specific use case.',
