  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'Option B (correct) is the initial and most crucial step: understanding the business problem and defining the ML task. Option A (correct) follows, as data characteristics directly influence algorithm choice. Option C (correct) is the logical next step, selecting an algorithm based on the problem and data. Option D (correct) comes after algorithm selection, as data preparation often depends on the chosen algorithm''s input requirements. This sequence ensures a methodical approach to algorithm selection.',
