VALUES (
  'q_15_m_15_2_125',
  'A data scientist is performing hyperparameter tuning for an Amazon SageMaker model to optimize its performance. Order the steps to effectively use SageMaker Automatic Model Tuning (HPO).',
  'ordering',
  '["Define the objective metric (e.g., accuracy, RMSE) that SageMaker HPO should optimize.","Specify the hyperparameter ranges and their types (e.g., continuous, categorical) for the search space.","Configure the SageMaker HPO job, including the maximum number of training jobs and the tuning strategy (e.g., Bayesian optimization).","Launch the HPO job and analyze the results to identify the best performing hyperparameter combination."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'Option A (correct) is the initial step, as HPO needs a clear goal to optimize. Option B (correct) defines the parameters HPO will explore. Option C (correct) sets up the mechanics of the tuning process, including the search strategy which is crucial for efficient optimization. Option D (correct) is the final step to execute and review the tuning process. This sequence ensures a structured approach to hyperparameter optimization with SageMaker HPO.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain15_3',
  NOW(),
  48,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_15_2',
