  '["Define an Amazon SageMaker Experiment to group related training runs.","Log training job parameters, metrics, and artifacts within the experiment.","Run multiple training jobs, each associated with the defined experiment.","Compare the performance and configurations of different trials within the experiment to identify the best model."]'::json,
  '{0,2,1,3}',
  'Option A (correct) is the initial setup to organize your work. Option C (correct) involves executing the actual training runs. Option B (correct) is the continuous logging that happens during or after each run, which is then grouped under the experiment. Option D (correct) is the analysis phase, where the logged data is used for comparison. This sequence ensures experiments are properly structured, executed, and analyzed for reproducibility.',
