  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'Option A (correct) is the starting point, choosing the base model. Option B (correct) is essential for adapting the model to the new domain. Option C (correct) involves setting up the actual fine-tuning process within SageMaker. Option D (correct) is the final step to verify the effectiveness of the fine-tuning. This sequence outlines the standard procedure for fine-tuning pre-trained models.',
