  '{2,1,0,3}',
  'To containerize a model for Amazon SageMaker and push it to Amazon ECR, the correct sequence of operations is to first create the repository, then build the Docker image, tag it, and finally push it. Option C (Create an Amazon ECR repository) is the initial step to provide a destination for the image. Option B (Build the Docker image locally) is performed after the repository exists. Option A (Tag the Docker image) must happen before pushing to ECR, using the repository URI. Option D (Push the Docker image to Amazon ECR) is the final step to make the image available.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain16_3',
  NOW(),
  1,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_16_2',
  'easy'
