  'An MLOps engineer wants to provision a SageMaker Notebook Instance using AWS CloudFormation. Order the following steps to successfully deploy this resource using an existing CloudFormation template.',
  'ordering',
  '["Review the CloudFormation stack events and resources.","Upload the CloudFormation template to an S3 bucket.","Create a new CloudFormation stack, specifying the S3 template URL and parameters.","Define the SageMaker Notebook Instance resource in a CloudFormation template."]'::json,
  '{3,1,2,0}',
  'Option D (Define the SageMaker Notebook Instance resource in a CloudFormation template) is the prerequisite step, as the template defines the infrastructure. Option B (Upload the CloudFormation template to an S3 bucket) makes the template accessible to CloudFormation. Option C (Create a new CloudFormation stack, specifying the S3 template URL and parameters) initiates the deployment process. Option A (Review the CloudFormation stack events and resources) is the final step to verify successful deployment and check for any issues.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain16_3',
