  'To begin any cost analysis, you must access the Cost Explorer. Option B (Open the AWS Cost Explorer console) is the first step. To focus on SageMaker, Option A (Apply a filter for ''SageMaker'' service) is necessary. To specifically identify inference costs, Option C (Group the costs by ''Usage Type'' to see inference-related charges) helps categorize the data. Finally, Option D (Review the cost and usage report for trends) allows for identifying patterns and potential optimization areas.',
