  '{0,1,2,3}'::int[],
  'To correctly configure a CloudWatch alarm for a SageMaker endpoint metric, the logical sequence is to first identify the resource. Option A (Select the SageMaker endpoint) is the initial step to scope the monitoring. Next, Option B (Specify the `Invocations` metric) identifies the specific metric to track. Following this, Option C (Define the alarm threshold and evaluation period) sets the conditions under which the alarm will trigger. Finally, Option D (Create the CloudWatch alarm) finalizes the configuration and activates the monitoring.',
