  '{1,3,0,2}'::int[],
  'Before you can monitor, you need a reference point. Option B (Generate baseline statistics and constraints from training data) establishes this. Next, you define what and how to monitor, so Option D (Specify the `MonitoringJobDefinition` including data quality rules) comes after the baseline. With the definition ready, Option A (Create a SageMaker `MonitoringSchedule`) sets up the recurring monitoring process. Finally, Option C (Associate the monitoring schedule with the SageMaker endpoint) links the monitoring to the live endpoint.',
