  '{0,1,2,3}'::int[],
  'To view results, you must first access the SageMaker console. Option A (Navigate to the Amazon SageMaker console) is the initial step. Within the console, Option B (Select the ''Monitoring schedules'' section) directs you to the relevant area. From there, Option C (Choose the specific monitoring schedule and view its execution history) allows you to select the job you''re interested in. Finally, Option D (Inspect the output reports and violations in Amazon S3) provides access to the detailed results generated by the monitor.',
