  'Order the steps to prepare baseline statistics for SageMaker Model Monitor from a dataset.',
  'ordering',
  '["Run a SageMaker processing job to generate baseline statistics.","Upload your training dataset to Amazon S3.","Define the `MonitoringJobDefinition` with input and output locations.","Specify the `BaselineConfig` in the monitoring schedule."]'::json,
  '{1,2,0,3}'::int[],
  'The raw data is the starting point for generating baselines. Option B (Upload your training dataset to Amazon S3) makes the data accessible. Next, you need to define how the baseline will be generated, so Option C (Define the `MonitoringJobDefinition` with input and output locations) sets up the processing task. With the definition ready, Option A (Run a SageMaker processing job to generate baseline statistics) executes the baseline generation. Finally, Option D (Specify the `BaselineConfig` in the monitoring schedule) links these generated baselines to the actual monitoring process.',
