  '{1,0,2,3}'::int[],
  'Detecting drift requires a reference point. Option B (Establish a baseline of data quality statistics and constraints) is the crucial first step. Next, you define the input for the monitoring job, so Option A (Configure a `DataQualityJobInput` for the monitoring schedule) specifies what data to analyze. With the baseline and input defined, Option C (Create a SageMaker Model Monitor schedule for data quality) sets up the recurring monitoring. Finally, Option D (Analyze the generated data quality reports for deviations) allows you to identify if drift has occurred.',
