  '{2,1,3,0}'::int[],
  'SageMaker Model Monitor is designed to detect various types of drift. These include Data quality drift (Option C), which refers to changes in the input data distribution; Model quality drift (Option B), which indicates a degradation in the model''s performance metrics; Bias drift (Option D), which monitors for changes in model fairness; and Feature attribution drift (Option A), which tracks shifts in how features contribute to predictions.',
