  '{2,1,0,3}'::int[],
  'To monitor feature attribution drift, the model must first be deployed to a SageMaker endpoint configured to capture feature attributions (Option C). Next, a baseline for feature attributions is generated using a representative dataset, which serves as the reference for future comparisons (Option B). With the baseline in place, a SageMaker Model Monitor schedule is created, explicitly configured for feature attribution drift monitoring (Option A). Finally, the generated monitoring reports are analyzed to identify and understand any significant shifts in feature importance over time (Option D).',
