  'To configure a notebook instance, you must first create it. Option B (Create a new SageMaker notebook instance) is the initial step. During creation, you specify its network environment, so Option A (Specify the VPC ID for the notebook instance) comes next. Within the VPC, you must choose a specific network segment, making Option C (Select a private subnet within the chosen VPC) the next step. Finally, Option D (Assign appropriate security groups to the notebook instance) controls network traffic to and from the instance.',
