  NULL,
  'The correct pairings are: ''Amazon Kinesis Data Streams'' with ''Real-time data capture'', ''Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose'' with ''Load to data stores'', and ''AWS Glue'' with ''ETL and cataloging''. Amazon Kinesis Data Streams is used for real-time capture and processing of large streams of data. Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose is a fully managed service for delivering real-time streaming data to various destinations like Amazon S3 or Amazon Redshift. AWS Glue is a serverless data integration service for ETL (Extract, Transform, Load) operations and maintaining a Data Catalog.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain14_3',
  NOW(),
  19,
  '{"left":["Amazon Kinesis Data Streams","Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose","AWS Glue"],"right":["ETL and cataloging","Real-time data capture","Load to data stores"]}'::json,
