  'A manufacturing company is implementing a predictive maintenance solution using machine learning. They need to ensure that their ML models are packaged consistently with all dependencies and can be easily deployed across different environments, from development to production. The MLOps team must utilize containerization best practices to achieve this portability and reproducibility.',
