  '{"A":"Endpoint auto-scaling","B":"Fixed capacity endpoint","C":"Manual scaling"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'Endpoint auto-scaling (Option A) for SageMaker endpoints dynamically adjusts the number of instances based on demand, making it cost-efficient for variable traffic. A fixed capacity endpoint (Option B) can lead to over-provisioning during low traffic or under-provisioning during high traffic, impacting cost or availability. Manual scaling (Option C) requires constant monitoring and intervention, resulting in high operational overhead.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain16_3',
  NOW(),
  36,
  '{"left":["Endpoint auto-scaling","Fixed capacity endpoint","Manual scaling"],"right":["Cost-efficient for variable traffic","Potential over/under-provisioning","High operational overhead"]}'::json,
