  NULL,
  'Amazon SageMaker Pipelines (Option A) is specifically designed for orchestrating and automating end-to-end machine learning workflows, including data preparation, model training, and deployment. AWS CodePipeline (Option B) is a continuous delivery service that automates the release process for software, covering build, test, and deployment stages. Amazon EventBridge (Option C) is a serverless event bus that enables event-driven architectures by routing events from various sources to targets, often used to trigger pipelines.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain16_3',
