  'matching',
  '{"A":"Data quality","B":"Model quality","C":"Feature attribution drift"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'The ''Data quality'' (left item 0) capability of SageMaker Model Monitor focuses on detecting issues like missing values, unexpected data types, or out-of-range values in the input data, corresponding to ''Input data issues'' (right item 0). ''Model quality'' (left item 1) monitoring assesses the actual performance of the model in production, such as accuracy, precision, or recall, matching ''Prediction performance'' (right item 1). ''Feature attribution drift'' (left item 2) detects changes in how much each feature contributes to the model''s predictions over time, aligning with ''Feature importance changes'' (right item 2).',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain17_3',
  NOW(),
  16,
  '{"left":["Data quality","Model quality","Feature attribution drift"],"right":["Input data issues","Prediction performance","Feature importance changes"]}'::json,
  '{"left":[0,1,2],"right":[0,1,2]}'::jsonb,
  'm_17_2',
