  NULL,
  'SageMaker Model Monitor (Option A) generates reports that provide insights into the quality and drift of your ML models in production. A Monitoring Baseline (Option B) is a reference set of data statistics and constraints generated from a training dataset or a representative inference dataset. Data Statistics (Option C) summarize the characteristics of a dataset, such as mean, median, and data types, which are used to establish the baseline.',
