  'matching',
  '{"A":"Baseline","B":"Monitoring schedule","C":"Analysis job"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'A Baseline (left item 0) in SageMaker Model Monitor establishes the normal behavior of the model and data, serving as a ''Reference for comparison'' (right item 0) for future observations. A Monitoring schedule (left item 1) configures SageMaker Model Monitor to perform ''Continuous data collection'' (right item 1) and analysis at regular intervals. An Analysis job (left item 2) allows for an ''On-demand drift check'' (right item 2) or a one-time analysis of a specific dataset against the baseline.',
  NOW(),
